    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3596" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρό-νυκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		lit. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rising at sunset</i>:
