				<u>Alm.</u>
				10.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				78
			</span></i>:—as Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νυκτος, ἡ</span>, with or without
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάσις</span>, <i>opposition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				10.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				77
			</span></i>. (Freq. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρων-</span>.)</div>
